---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Counselling Services | AOC, Calgary";
const description = "Explore the planned counselling focus at AOC: mental health, wellbeing, addictions and substance use.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Counselling services</div><h1>Start with what<br>matters to you.</h1><p class="lead">You may have a clear goal, a question you can’t quite name, or simply a sense that something needs to change.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Two connected areas<br>of focus.</h2><div class="step"><h3>Addictions & substance use</h3><p>Space to consider the role of alcohol or other substances in your life, including mixed feelings about change, effects on relationships, and the kind of support you want.</p><a class="text-link" href="/addictions/">Explore substance use support ↗</a></div><div class="step"><h3>Mental health & wellbeing</h3><p>A place to discuss emotional distress, patterns in relationships, uncertainty, and the demands of changing circumstances.</p><a class="text-link" href="/mental-health/">Explore mental health support ↗</a></div><h3>Practical details, before you commit</h3><p>Fees, session length, delivery format, eligibility, and any insurance arrangements will be confirmed before booking opens. A conversation about fit comes before deciding whether to begin.</p></div><aside class="side-box"><h3>Not sure where to start?</h3><p>You do not need to choose the perfect service category. What has been difficult, and what you hope could be different, are useful starting points.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Consultation details ↗</a></aside></div></div></main>
</Layout>
